# ============================================================
#  统一换行符: 仓库内一律存 LF, 检出到 Windows 自动转 CRLF
#  避免 Windows/Linux 之间协作时 diff 显示"整个文件都改了"
# ============================================================

* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.elf  binary
*.bin  binary
*.hex  binary
*.pdf  binary

# 汇编/C 源码按文本处理
*.c    text
*.h    text
*.s    text
*.md   text
*.json text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text

# 让 GitHub 识别语言构成(避免被当成汇编项目)
*.s    linguist-language=Assembly
